I have attached the required identification documents [e.g., a copy of my U.S. passport/driver's license] and the completed application form [e.g., Form SS-5 in the US] as required for this request. 

Please let me know if you need any additional information or further documentation to process this request. You can reach me at [Your Phone Number] or [Your Email Address].

Thank you for your time and assistance.

Sincerely,

[Your Full Name]
[Your Mailing Address]

***

**Next Steps (If you are in the US):**
Instead of mailing a letter, the fastest and most secure way to request a replacement card is usually online through the official **"my Social Security"** account on the SSA.gov website, provided you meet the requirements. If you cannot do it online, you will need to print and fill out **Form SS-5** and mail it or take it to your local SSA office along with your original unexpired identification documents.

